Job Summary: &nbsp; 

We are&nbsp; seeking&nbsp; a highly skilled Microservices Developer with&nbsp; expertise&nbsp; in Java, Spring Boot, MongoDB, MySQL, Redis, and RabbitMQ. The ideal candidate will&nbsp; be responsible for&nbsp; designing, developing, and&nbsp; maintaining&nbsp; scalable microservices architectures while ensuring high performance and reliability. &nbsp; 

&nbsp; 

